            "slot": "s712",
            "repere": "Intertitre · I couldn’t find a brand I trusted. So …",
            "text": "I couldn’t find a brand I trusted. So I built one.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s714",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · It started with a supplement I almost …",
            "text": "It started with a supplement I almost bought for my parents. The label looked impressive. But I couldn’t find any test results, and the dose was a fraction of what the research used.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s715",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · The Army drilled honor and integrity i…",
            "text": "The Army drilled honor and integrity into me. You don’t cut corners when people are counting on you. The supplement industry cut them everywhere I looked.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s716",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · So I built Luma to a higher standard: …",
            "text": "So I built Luma to a higher standard: meaningful doses, independent testing on every batch, and <span style=\"color:var(--atl-texte, rgb(20, 24, 26));font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline\">verified</span> results anyone can see.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s717",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Nothing goes in these bottles that I w…",
            "text": "Nothing goes in these bottles that I wouldn’t give my family or take myself. We’ll never ask you to trust a claim we aren’t willing to prove.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s718",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Questions? Reach out. I read and answe…",
            "text": "Questions? Reach out. I read and answer them.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
